{
 "item": "m07",
 "show": "dbza",
 "youtube": "m0JME7eodTk",
 "title": "DragonBall Z Abridged SPECIAL: Episode of Bardock",
 "duration": 777,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 15.14,
   "end": 22.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "A familiar scene plays before you: A lone renegade stands at the precipice of global annihilation..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 22.32,
   "end": 25.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "The grim punctuation to his warrior race."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 25.92,
   "end": 33.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You know, the funny thing is, *Bardock*, even if you had seen this coming, there's nothing you could have done about it."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 33.48,
   "end": 36.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "You don't... You have no goddamned idea."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 36.6,
   "end": 41.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Zarbon",
   "text": "Mmm, and even if you told every single Saiyan, none of them would have even believed you."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 41.4,
   "end": 43.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Just... please stop talking."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 43.52,
   "end": 48.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dodoria",
   "text": "And you never even got a chance to say goodbye to your son."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 48.06,
   "end": 49.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'I have one of those?'"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 49.26,
   "end": 51.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "(Gasp) 'Oh God, I have two of those!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 51.14,
   "end": 54.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Consider this downsizing on a global scale!"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 55.18,
   "end": 57.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You can pickup your unemployment checks wherever you end up."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 57.54,
   "end": 59.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "GO TO HELL!"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 59.28,
   "end": 61.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "See, that was my first guess."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 64.1,
   "end": 65.92,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mooks yell in terror"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 64.1,
   "end": 65.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Ah, crapbaskets."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 66.84,
   "end": 77.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "And so, with a macabre flash of blinding light, the howling laughter of a blood-parched tyrant echoing through his mind, so ends the tragic fate of Bardock."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 79.12,
   "end": 84.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "...Or so you'd think, if you didn't know a thing about merchandising!"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 84.42,
   "end": 85.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Hit it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 85.68,
   "end": 90.04,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "\"Time Warp (Rocky Horror Picture Show)\""
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 85.68,
   "end": 90.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "♫ Let's do the Time Warp again ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 90.04,
   "end": 90.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Ah!"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 93.26,
   "end": 94.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Am I in a bed?'"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 94.94,
   "end": 96.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Does Hell have beds?'"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 96.74,
   "end": 98.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'You'd think they'd have beds of spikes...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 98.94,
   "end": 100.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'or spiders...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 100.58,
   "end": 102.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'or spiky spiders...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 103.24,
   "end": 104.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Spikers.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 105.78,
   "end": 108.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Wait... this looks like Planet Vegeta.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 108.58,
   "end": 111.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Only... even shittier...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 111.52,
   "end": 115.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'...which is and isn't weird, considering the last time I saw it, it was blowing up.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 115.58,
   "end": 116.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "Hi-ho!"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 115.58,
   "end": 116.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 116.68,
   "end": 120.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "We found you unconscious and near-death in a valley not too far from here."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 120.58,
   "end": 123.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "We helped bring you back to health with our magical, healing S.P.U.G. (\"spooge\")."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 123.84,
   "end": 124.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 124.34,
   "end": 126.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "Super Polymorphic Unleashing Gel."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 126.44,
   "end": 129.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "We brought you to our town in our pleasant, serene, little planet."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 129.66,
   "end": 133.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "My name is Dray. And this is my child, Twopock. Say hi-ho, Twopock."
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 133.42,
   "end": 134.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "Hi-ho!"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 134.04,
   "end": 134.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Ugh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 134.6,
   "end": 135.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "Where are you from?"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 136.32,
   "end": 141.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "There is nothing about this whole scenario that doesn't make me so disgusted I want to violently vomit out my own internal organs."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 142.0,
   "end": 148.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "I despise you both so intensely, that I can't tell if my vision is blurry from my near-death experience or from my unforgiving rage."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 148.28,
   "end": 156.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "If allowed, once I am back to full health, I will gut you with an honest to God smile on my face, and then proceed to paint the home I built with your bodies with your very blood."
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 158.0,
   "end": 159.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "You hear that, Twopock? You made a friend."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 159.9,
   "end": 161.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "YEAAAAAAAAAAA--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 162.7,
   "end": 164.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "That came from my village!"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 166.32,
   "end": 170.14,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "screaming"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 170.14,
   "end": 172.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Toobi",
   "text": "Hello there, inhabitants of Planet Plant!"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 172.86,
   "end": 177.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Toobi",
   "text": "We are here on a diplomatic mission on behalf of your new Emperor, Lord Chilled."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 177.56,
   "end": 182.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Toobi",
   "text": "Pamphlets will be passed around to introduce you to your new, exciting lives as slaves to his Almighty Horniness."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 182.72,
   "end": 186.92,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Really? This is how you intimidate a village? Blow up a house or two?"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 186.92,
   "end": 189.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "I don't even think you killed anyone with those peashooters."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 189.26,
   "end": 192.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Speaking of which - what models are those? They look ancient."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 192.12,
   "end": 195.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Kayabira",
   "text": "Hey, we were gonna kill one of the sick ones if they didn't comply."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 195.22,
   "end": 197.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Oh, kill one of the *sick* ones."
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 197.64,
   "end": 199.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "What are you gonna do next? Waterboard the elderly?"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 199.88,
   "end": 201.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Kayabira",
   "text": "Look, buddy, we didn't come here to be judged by you."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 202.78,
   "end": 204.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Kayabira",
   "text": "Ugh-haa...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 204.1,
   "end": 204.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Toobi",
   "text": "Holy--"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 208.44,
   "end": 209.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Pffff. Amateurs."
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 210.5,
   "end": 214.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Villager",
   "text": "Hooray! Everyone give praise to our new Violent Savior!"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 210.5,
   "end": 214.6,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Villagers sing \"Welcome Christmas\""
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 214.6,
   "end": 218.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Villager",
   "text": "♫ Bahoo dores ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 218.98,
   "end": 219.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "NO!"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 220.42,
   "end": 221.3,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "None of that!"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 222.02,
   "end": 223.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Shame on you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 232.04,
   "end": 236.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Who needs villagers with their soft beds and S.P.U.G.? Rocks are soft enough to sleep on, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 239.92,
   "end": 241.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "...I've made a terrible mistake."
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 245.0,
   "end": 248.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Soldier",
   "text": "Lord Chilled! The vital sensors in the blasters of the two scouts you just sent-"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 248.64,
   "end": 251.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "Shhshhshhshhshhshhshhshhshhshhshhshhshh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 254.64,
   "end": 255.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "Continue."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 255.96,
   "end": 259.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Soldier",
   "text": "- have ceased transmission. We believe they're dead!"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 259.08,
   "end": 261.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "(gasp) ♪ OUTRAGEOUS! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 261.76,
   "end": 268.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "In honor of their deaths, my men shall now, and forevermore, be given the names of fruits!"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 268.4,
   "end": 271.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "Pineapple! Bring us to Planet Plant!"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 273.3,
   "end": 274.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Pineapple",
   "text": "...So am I \"Pineapple\"?"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 274.68,
   "end": 276.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "♪ YES! ♪"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 282.34,
   "end": 284.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Alright, I think I might've figured this out.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 284.78,
   "end": 287.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'This looks like a younger Planet Vegeta...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 287.18,
   "end": 289.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Those two guys were using older models...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 290.0,
   "end": 291.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Maybe...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 291.34,
   "end": 292.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'This is the--'"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 292.16,
   "end": 292.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "Hi-ho!"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 292.7,
   "end": 294.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Annnd, I lost my train of thought."
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 294.32,
   "end": 297.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "Hello, Violent Savior. I have brought you bread and fruit."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 297.38,
   "end": 299.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "I don't want your bread, or your fruit!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 299.7,
   "end": 300.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "But leave the basket!"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 301.16,
   "end": 302.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "But, Violent Savior--"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 302.06,
   "end": 302.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "LEAVE THE BASKET!"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 302.86,
   "end": 308.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "(crying)"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 305.74,
   "end": 308.26,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'I swear to God, I'm gonna eat his entire race...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 315.06,
   "end": 316.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "'Damn it, I filled up on bread!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 321.04,
   "end": 324.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Twopock",
   "text": "Here you are, Violent Savior. I have brought you more food that you detest."
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 324.88,
   "end": 329.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Seriously kid, if you don't start bringing me meat, I am literally gonna shit bricks."
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 330.76,
   "end": 332.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "THAT IS A ROCK!"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 334.82,
   "end": 338.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Rizza",
   "text": "Thank you, Dr. Dray. Your S.P.U.G. has cured my syphilis."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 338.24,
   "end": 339.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "You are welcome, Rizza."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 339.54,
   "end": 341.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Rizza",
   "text": "Well, back to what I was doing before."
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 341.46,
   "end": 343.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "Oh, you are just incorrigible."
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 347.78,
   "end": 350.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Papaya",
   "text": "Hello. We are the Space Police."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 350.14,
   "end": 351.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Aice Cube",
   "text": "Man, f*** da police!"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 351.44,
   "end": 352.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "Not now, Aice Cube!"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 352.84,
   "end": 357.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Papaya",
   "text": "We are here to catch evil space criminals and various other ne'er-do-wells."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 357.14,
   "end": 360.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "I can assure you that we have already exiled Chris of the Clan Brown from our planet."
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 361.06,
   "end": 366.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chilled",
   "text": "We are looking for the man who assassinated two emissaries from the Frost planet!"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 366.24,
   "end": 367.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dr. Dray",
   "text": "You mean the Violent Savior?"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 367.64,
   "end": 369.88,
