  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 682.04,
   "end": 683.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Pineapple",
   "text": "Well, call it, Blueberry."
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 683.5,
   "end": 685.5,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Blueberry",
   "text": "Do I still have to call myself Blueberry?"
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 685.6,
   "end": 687.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Raisin",
   "text": "Well I'm gonna keep calling you Blueberry."
  },
  {
   "i": 223,
   "start": 687.12,
   "end": 688.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Blueberry",
   "text": "Shut up, Raisin!"
  },
  {
   "i": 224,
   "start": 688.66,
   "end": 694.54,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "And so, with the evil Chilled put to rest, the unlikely hero made his way."
  },
  {
   "i": 225,
   "start": 695.12,
   "end": 697.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "And that is the story of how your"
  },
  {
   "i": 226,
   "start": 696.28,
   "end": 700.82,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "story of how your Grandpa Bardock became the Legendary Super Saiyan."
  },
  {
   "i": 227,
   "start": 701.78,
   "end": 703.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "OK. A couple questions."
  },
  {
   "i": 228,
   "start": 703.38,
   "end": 703.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Sure."
  },
  {
   "i": 229,
   "start": 703.96,
   "end": 706.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Why did Freeza's Death Ball send him back in time?"
  },
  {
   "i": 230,
   "start": 706.54,
   "end": 707.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I dunno."
  },
  {
   "i": 231,
   "start": 707.34,
   "end": 709.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "And what happened to his psychic powers?"
  },
  {
   "i": 232,
   "start": 709.6,
   "end": 710.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I dunno."
  },
  {
   "i": 233,
   "start": 710.34,
   "end": 712.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "And why did all the little Saiyans sound the same?"
  },
  {
   "i": 234,
   "start": 712.96,
   "end": 716.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I couldn't remember which was which, honestly, so I just went with it."
  },
  {
   "i": 235,
   "start": 716.56,
   "end": 719.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Well, I'm sorry, it's just... none of this makes any sense."
  },
  {
   "i": 236,
   "start": 720.0,
   "end": 722.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Well, of course it doesn't. None of this is actually happening."
  },
  {
   "i": 237,
   "start": 723.68,
   "end": 724.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "...Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 238,
   "start": 724.48,
   "end": 725.58,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "None of this is real!"
  },
  {
   "i": 239,
   "start": 725.62,
   "end": 726.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "What are you talking abou--"
  },
  {
   "i": 240,
   "start": 726.78,
   "end": 727.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "(Gasp)"
  },
  {
   "i": 241,
   "start": 732.54,
   "end": 734.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "...Go back to sleep, Gohan."
  },
  {
   "i": 242,
   "start": 734.5,
   "end": 736.5,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"Back in Time\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 243,
   "start": 738.0,
   "end": 743.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "♫ Gotta get back in time ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 244,
   "start": 747.18,
   "end": 749.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Seriously, you wanna learn how to traumatize a village?"
  },
  {
   "i": 245,
   "start": 749.44,
   "end": 750.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "OK. See that kid over there?"
  },
  {
   "i": 246,
   "start": 752.34,
   "end": 754.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Villager",
   "text": "Odieby! Noooo!"
  },
  {
   "i": 247,
   "start": 754.4,
   "end": 755.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Hear that mother?"
  },
  {
   "i": 248,
   "start": 755.14,
   "end": 757.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Villager",
   "text": "(Bawling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 249,
   "start": 755.14,
   "end": 757.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "... *That*... is distraught."
  },
  {
   "i": 250,
   "start": 757.84,
   "end": 762.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Kayabira",
   "text": "You should write a book. You're like a brilliant scientist!"
  },
  {
   "i": 251,
   "start": 762.8,
   "end": 764.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bardock",
   "text": "Well, I am working on this fake moon thing."
  }
 ],
